+## Symbolic links
+
+Symbolic links in ZIP and squashfs archives are skipped by default, with a
+notice suggesting `--links` (`-l`). With `--links`, they are exposed as files
+whose names have a `.rclonelink` suffix and whose contents are the link target.
+Links are not followed within the archive.
+
+To recreate the links when copying to a local filesystem, use `--links`:
+
+```sh
+rclone copy --links :archive:/tmp/test.zip /tmp/out
+```
+
 ## Modification times
 
 Modification times are preserved with an accuracy depending on the archive type.
